description:
Use Cases:



1. DAO founders can accept sessions bookings using the token-gated free booking mode with DAO members;

2. A freelance English teacher from Poland can sell sessions for 50 USDC per 30 mins to his/her students;

3. A celebrity/influencer can sell sessions for 500 USD per 6 minutes to his/her followers;

4. Social token issuers can accept sessions bookings using paid sessions mode with specified tokens.
